.claude/
# ModelSim work products
SIM/**/work/
SIM/**/transcript
SIM/**/vsim.wlf
SIM/**/wlft*
SIM/**/*.mem
SIM/**/modelsim.ini
# Switching-activity dumps for the Quartus Power Analyzer. Megabytes, and
# regenerable in a minute with "do gen_vcd.do", so the script is committed
# and the output is not.
SIM/**/*.vcd

# Quartus IP generation. The .qsys sources, the synthesis output and the
# ModelSim simulation models ARE committed - the design needs them. Ignored
# here: setup scripts for simulators we do not use, and generation reports.
QUARTUS/*/simulation/aldec/
QUARTUS/*/simulation/cadence/
QUARTUS/*/simulation/synopsys/
QUARTUS/*/*_generation*.rpt
QUARTUS/*/*.html
QUARTUS/*/*.csv
QUARTUS/*/synthesis/*.debuginfo
QUARTUS/.qsys_edit/

# Editor backups. The submission requires DUT/ to contain design files only,
# and a *.vhd.bak sitting next to the real source is both clutter and a trap
# for anyone adding files to the Quartus project by wildcard.
*.bak

# Office scratch files. Word leaves these next to an open document: "~$name"
# is the lock file that records who has it open, and ~WRLnnnn.tmp is crash
# recovery scratch. The documents themselves under DOC/ are committed.
~$*
*.tmp
~WRL*.tmp
